&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="6537" data-local-id="31c16cbbb331"&gt;A desire to learn and develop your skills through a growth mindset.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos="6608" data-local-id="b8cc3b003b8e"&gt;Demonstrated abilities in driving operational excellence and software best practices.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
